   124	
   125	真实 CLI 筛选输出：
   126	
   127	```sh
   128	jq -c '.items[]|select(
   129	  .name=="ADV-重复DOI-C3.md" or
   130	  .name=="ADV-重复DOI-C4.md" or
   131	  .name=="ADV-重复URL.md"
   132	)|{name,criterion,verdict,confident,exact_duplicate_of,uncertain_reason,basis}' \
   133	  "$B/adversarial/out/inbox-preview-_待处理.json"
   134	```
   135	
   136	```text
   137	{"name":"ADV-重复DOI-C3.md","criterion":"C3_empty_or_skeleton","verdict":"建议删","confident":true,"exact_duplicate_of":null,"uncertain_reason":null,"basis":"剥离 frontmatter / HTML 注释后实质正文 0 字符（33 字节文件：标题 0 行、纯结构行 0 行、代码围栏 0 行、其余皆空行或注释）"}
   138	{"name":"ADV-重复DOI-C4.md","criterion":"C4_exact_duplicate","verdict":"建议删","confident":true,"exact_duplicate_of":"节点/库内正本.md","uncertain_reason":null,"basis":"归一化正文与 节点/库内正本.md 逐字相等（sha256 相同）"}
   139	{"name":"ADV-重复URL.md","criterion":"C3_empty_or_skeleton","verdict":"建议删","confident":true,"exact_duplicate_of":null,"uncertain_reason":null,"basis":"剥离 frontmatter / HTML 注释后实质正文 0 字符（46 字节文件：标题 0 行、纯结构行 0 行、代码围栏 0 行、其余皆空行或注释）"}
   140	```
   141	
   142	URL 反例是：
   143	
   144	```yaml
   145	---
   146	url:
   147	url: https://example.test/hidden
   148	---
   149	```
   150	
   151	把 URL/DOI 放在首个同名值，或改用不同键，对照均为 `C6 / 拿不准 / false`。因此这是“有来源材料被确定删除”，同时穿透 C3、C4 两个出口。
   152	
